<h3 data-section-id=3D"18al4kk" data-start=3D"67" data-end=3D"128">Option 1=
: Same Excel File, Different Sheets (Recommended)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"129" data-end=3D"180">Create one Excel workbook named <str=
ong data-start=3D"161" data-end=3D"179">TestCases.xlsx</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"182" data-end=3D"232">At the bottom, create separate sheet=
s if you want:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"233" data-end=3D"292">
